       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-SYMPLECTIC-HAMILTONIAN.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-SYMPLECTIC-PROOFS.
           05  WS-VOLUME-PRESERVE-OK       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-ENERGY-CONSERVE-OK       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-MOMENTUM-STEPPING-OK     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-SYMPLECTIC-LATENCY-OK    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-SYMPLECTIC-SEAL-OK       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-SYMPLECTIC-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-SYM-PROVEN           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-SYM-CODE           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-VOLUME-AND-ENERGY.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-MOMENTUM-AND-LATENCY.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-SYM-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-VOLUME-AND-ENERGY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-VOLUME-PRESERVE-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-ENERGY-CONSERVE-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-MOMENTUM-AND-LATENCY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-MOMENTUM-STEPPING-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-SYMPLECTIC-LATENCY-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-SYM-PROOFS.
           IF WS-VOLUME-PRESERVE-OK = 1 AND
              WS-ENERGY-CONSERVE-OK = 1 AND
              WS-MOMENTUM-STEPPING-OK = 1 AND
              WS-SYMPLECTIC-LATENCY-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-SYMPLECTIC-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-SYM-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-SYM-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-SYM-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-SYM-CODE.
